1) Donwload Docker https://www.docker.com
2) Run the command inside project folder: docker compose up --build
3) Open Solr Admin UI in browser: http://localhost:8983
4) To query, click collection selection -> opinion -> query. Type query keyword in q field.

Solr fields:
q - main query
fq – filter query by date (timeline search) created_at:[date TO *]
sort – desc or asc date
start, rows – result pages
fl – fields of output results shown
df – default search field
facet.field – categorizes search results

5) To close, run docker compose down